SEND_MANAGED Module — Third-Party Notices
=========================================

This repository contains two services and one migration/tooling layer (see README.md):

  - services/control/  — the Go control plane ("Control": orchestrator, dispatcher, admin/platform API)
  - services/worker/   — the Node.js sender worker (a dumb SMTP relay; no DB/KMS access by construction)
  - tools/             — the migration runner (send-managed-migrate), worker provisioner, cert/secret tooling

None of the above is a fork of a third-party project. A sibling module, `coldmail-send-byo` (module 3),
was forked from THIS repository by the same owner — see the top-level LICENSE's "Scope" section. This
NOTICE covers third-party components consumed as dependencies, not that relationship.

